                                                                            <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> """The ELSEWeb mappings ontology imports related upper level ontologies and vocabularies and aligns ELSEWeb ontologies to importec classes. This ontology provides support for the ELSEWeb project(http://elseweb.cybershare.utep.edu/).
website: http://elseweb.cybershare.utep.edu/ontologies
email: nvillanuevarosales@utep.edu
