<http://purl.org/dc/terms/Location> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                                    rdfs:label "location".
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/PeriodOfTime> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                                        rdfs:label "period of time".
<http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                                              rdfs:label "concept".
<http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
